DESCRIPTION: \n“The Best Man” Auditions!\n \n“Let the best man win!” Exciti
 ng new production of Gore Vidal’s searing political drama of an intellectua
 l idealist and a ruthless opportunist battling it out for the endorsement o
 f an ex-president on the eve of an unnamed political party’s nominating con
 vention.\n \nDirected by David Houlden.\nRehearsals generally Sunday\, Tues
 day & Thursday evenings beginning September 3rd. \nWe are looking for 12 ac
 tors (6-8 men\, 4-6 women) ages 30’s – 70’s. Non-equity/volunteer.\nAuditio
 ns will be from the script.\n \nWhen: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026 5:00 pm-8:0
 0 pm\nWhere: The Actors Studio of Newburyport\, 1 Merrill St. #3\, Salisbur
 y MA 01952\nPerformance Dates: October 16\, 17\, 18\, 23\, 24 & 25\, 2026\n
  \nEmail David Houlden for audition time dshoulden@gmail.com\n 
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T041652Z
LOCATION:The Actors Studio – Crossroads Plaza\, 1 Merrill Street\, Unit # 3
 \, Salisbury\, MA\, 01952
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:​[The Actor's Studio of Newburyport\, Newburyport] The Best Man - A
 uditions
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
