DESCRIPTION:Join WildFire at Kowloon outdoors under the stars! Plenty of se
 ating\, fun outdoor patio area with full-service dining\, bar and more!<br>
 <br>Aloha! The Pina Coladas are frozen\, the theme is set\, we’ll have a Lu
 au\, you’ll never forget! It’s tiki time! Come luau with us as we celebrate
  good friends\, great food\, and lots of tropical spirit. Escape and party 
 with us. Delicious food and drinks\, great company and unforgettable memori
 es await! Join us for a night of island-style fun as we turn up the heat at
  this fun filled Celebration. Let’s hula the night away! Party Favors* &amp
 \; Photo booth. Pu Pu Platter Specials available this evening. Wear your Ha
 waiian shirts and grass skirts for your chance to win great prizes for best
  Hawaiian attire. Get ready to hula your way into a night of summer fun and
  festivities\, let’s set this party on WILDFIRE! Raise your glass to good t
 imes and because it's going to be a night to remember at Kowloon Outdoor Co
 ncert Series.<br><br><br>General Admission - Free<br>Reserved Seating: $10/
 person - purchase online ordering at <a href="http://kowloonrestaurant.com/
 " target="_blank"><u><u><u><u>Kowloonrestaurant.com</u></u></u></u></a><br>
 Weather permitting &amp\; subject to change without notice.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T041654Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:​[Kowloon\, Saugus] Live Music - SOLD OUT - WildFire Luau Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
