DESCRIPTION:                                                               
                 \n\n\n\n  \n• Have fun and share some laughs while learning
  Improv  \n• Become a better listener (to others and your own ideas!)\n• Le
 arn to access your playful nature!\n• Find your funny and have some laughs!
 \n• Brush up on Improv skills and meet new people in your community!\n \n \
 nExploring Improv – In addition to reviewing the basic “rules” of improv su
 ch as active listening\, agreeing (“Yes-anding”)\, and creating scenes out 
 of thin air\, we will also explore several different improv structures & ga
 mes to help reinforce the concepts over the 6-week class. This course will 
 culminate in a performance open to the public.\n \n\n \n  \nEthan Jule\nEth
 an has been studying Improv for over ten years and has graduated from the U
 pright Citizens Brigade training program\, the Improv Asylum training progr
 am and was selected to be part of an Improv Asylum House Team performing at
  the IA theatre in Boston. Additionally\, he has taken classes with Kismet 
 Improv and members of the legendary Improv team “The Stepfathers” based out
  of NYC. He hosts a weekly podcast called “No Outlet” and cannot wait to se
 e you in class!For more information e-mail ejule444@gmail.com or call 207-6
 98-0199\n  \n        \n  \nWhen: Mondays- 5:30pm to 7:00pm – August 3 to Se
 ptember 14\, 2026\n******** NOTE: No class Labor Day Monday September 7 ***
 ***\nWhere: The Actor’s Studio 1 Merrill St #3\, Salisbury\, MA 01952\nCour
 se Fee: $299 for six classes and an optional performance\nPerformance (opti
 onal) date: September 17\, 2026\n \nTO REGISTER\, Call Marc at 978-518-0637
  or email classes@newburyportacting.org\n \nPAYMENT OPTIONS:\nPay by checks
 \, made out to TASN\nand mail to: TASN\, 1 Merrill St #3\, Salisbury MA 019
 52\nor\nuse the PayPal link below:  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \nAlso – See Cl
 asses page for details.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T041652Z
LOCATION:The Actors Studio – Crossroads Plaza\, 1 Merrill Street\, Unit # 3
 \, Salisbury\, MA\, 01952
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:​[The Actor's Studio of Newburyport\, Newburyport] Intro to Improv 
 with Ethan Jule
TRANSP:OPAQUE
