DESCRIPTION:Join us for classes on Wednesday evenings and Thursday & Friday
  mornings. All you need is your willingness to do a cold reading from one o
 f the scenes Marc has chosen – and have a good time.\n\n  \nCLASS DESCRIPTI
 ON\nThis is a workout class that purposely includes actors at every level o
 f experience\, from beginners to pro’s\, and also offers invaluable opportu
 nities for non-actors in the way of personal growth and discovery. Using pl
 ays and screenplays\, students learn ways of reaching full expression and a
 ccess to their own authenticity\, along with simple techniques for breath c
 ontrol\, focus and other performance skills.  “I keep the environment safe 
 for everyone to explore your own limitlessness.”The cold reading classes ar
 e ongoing. Multi-week commitments are preferred.Learn more about Marc Clopt
 on here.\n \nTo register: email Marc at classes@newburyportacting.org or ca
 ll 979-518-0637.\n \nYou will need:  To show proof of being fully vaccinate
 d by sending a photo of your vaccination card to Marc at classes@newburypor
 tacting.org\, or by bringing your card to your first class.\n \nWhen:  Wedn
 esday’s at 7:00 p.m.\,  Thursday’s at 10:30 a.m. and  Friday’s at 10:00 a.m
 .\n \nWhere:1 Merrill Street\, Salisbury MA\, Unit #3\, Crossroads Plaza\n 
 \n.Class Fees:\n \n$35 per class  (option to pay $35 via PayPal)\n$195 for 
 six classes  (option to pay $195 via PayPal)\n$360 for twelve classes  (opt
 ion to pay $360 via PayPal)\n  \n\nAlso – See Classes page for details.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T041652Z
LOCATION:The Actors Studio – Crossroads Plaza\, 1 Merrill Street\, Unit # 3
 \, Salisbury\, MA\, 01952
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:​[The Actor's Studio of Newburyport\, Newburyport] Ongoing Cold Rea
 ding Classes with Marc Clopton
TRANSP:OPAQUE
