DESCRIPTION:We have TWO house teams at TASN! This is the first time ever th
 at we will be showcasing both of them and we are excited! You should be too
 ! For only $5 you can check them both out and still have time for dinner an
 d/or a couple of drinks. Grab a friend of a few of them and join in on the 
 fun!\n \n \n\nEthan Jule\n \n \nEthan has been studying Improv for over ten
  years and has graduated from the Upright Citizens Brigade training program
 \, the Improv Asylum training program and was selected to be part of an Imp
 rov Asylum House Team performing at the IA theatre in Boston. Additionally\
 , he has taken classes with Kismet Improv and members of the legendary Impr
 ov team “The Stepfathers” based out of NYC. He hosts a weekly podcast calle
 d “No Outlet” and cannot wait to see you in class!\n \n \nFor more informat
 ion e-mail ejule444@gmail.com or call 207-698-0199\n \n \nWhen: Thursday Au
 gust 20\, 7pm\nWhere: The Actor’s Studio 1 Merrill St #3\, Salisbury\, MA 0
 1952\nTickets: $5\n  \nBuy Tickets Here
